        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Winter Heat</i> is a narrative game about love in the internet age.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429850/extras/7000b1fc4101b52fe4b4c0aecd1571af.avif?t=1787001825\" width=885 height=158 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429850/extras/df793790dd182b228f4309931c2d5f9b.avif?t=1787001825\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429850/extras_big/df793790dd182b228f4309931c2d5f9b.webp?t=1787001825 width=1560 height=1240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429850/extras/0e03073fc32f6d2baff6c3f45ff50342.avif?t=1787001825\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429850/extras_big/0e03073fc32f6d2baff6c3f45ff50342.webp?t=1787001825 width=1560 height=1240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429850/extras/5395bd48f5dcb10ef7bf7a26666181be.avif?t=1787001825\" width=885 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Javiera Vera lives in the sweltering urban summer of Santiago, Chile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fukkoshi Shio lives in the snowy seaside town of Miyazu, Kyoto, in Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The two are long-time internet friends, living across the world, across time zones, but with a bond as strong as the fiber optic cables connecting them. How will that bond transform, though, during one special December?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Javi and Shio through their online lives as they grow even closer together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429850/extras/49cd7099a4e964fafd3fcb21c6743f6d.avif?t=1787001825\" width=885 height=158 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fluffy, fun romance story across continents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A linear main storyline taking place through online chats, video calls, browser MMOs, and social media accounts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigames and narrative storytelling in the form of &quot;apps&quot; on your device--Maps, Gallery, Cawmix, Noteswap, Test Your English, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus sub-game included: Oomfie RPG, a dungeon crawling deckbuilder adventure! A complete standalone experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more content to each mode coming in future updates</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429850/extras/1d5e2871dc2434b10ab5f3b9ffd15a75.avif?t=1787001825\" width=885 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Oomfie RPG! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each copy of <i>Winter Heat</i> comes with a ROM of one of Javi and Shio’s favorite nostalgic games: Oomfie World IV: The 1994 Saga of Turbo. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After her best friend Dot is sucked into the hot new game console, Oomfie must traverse the digital world of Turbo and collect pieces of the Virtual Cuboid Console to send them both back. Journey through mysterious randomized Adventure Zones and collect RPG skills to power Oomfie up and help her save her best friend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429850/extras/85787f8b07fe9223bc1e65cfdef12e7e.poster.avif?t=1787001825\" width=700 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429850/extras/85787f8b07fe9223bc1e65cfdef12e7e.webm?t=1787001825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Yeah, we made a mini-deckbuilder roguelike RPG as a sub-game within a romantic Yuri visual novel, why do you ask?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429850/extras/9af632923c4c7847990ad25c27935a9d.avif?t=1787001825\" width=885 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuri Kissaten is a game studio that makes narrative-focused games about girls loving girls, founded in 2024 by Fruz and Beatrice Baker. We create experiences with strong stories and memorable characters. All Yuri Kissaten projects focus primarily on LGBTQ+ characters and their relationships, romantic and otherwise. We hope you enjoy our games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main team working on <i>Winter Heat</i> consists of:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fruz: Director, artist, story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beatrice Baker: Writing, game design, planning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >linguisticspaceship: Programming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joi Massat: Marketing, game design, additional art</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Winter Heat</i> is a narrative game about love in the internet age.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429850/extras/7000b1fc4101b52fe4b4c0aecd1571af.avif?t=1787001825\" width=885 height=158 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429850/extras/df793790dd182b228f4309931c2d5f9b.avif?t=1787001825\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429850/extras_big/df793790dd182b228f4309931c2d5f9b.webp?t=1787001825 width=1560 height=1240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429850/extras/0e03073fc32f6d2baff6c3f45ff50342.avif?t=1787001825\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429850/extras_big/0e03073fc32f6d2baff6c3f45ff50342.webp?t=1787001825 width=1560 height=1240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429850/extras/5395bd48f5dcb10ef7bf7a26666181be.avif?t=1787001825\" width=885 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Javiera Vera lives in the sweltering urban summer of Santiago, Chile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fukkoshi Shio lives in the snowy seaside town of Miyazu, Kyoto, in Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The two are long-time internet friends, living across the world, across time zones, but with a bond as strong as the fiber optic cables connecting them. How will that bond transform, though, during one special December?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Javi and Shio through their online lives as they grow even closer together.</p><